# Milestone: M6 Wave 2
# Covers: Phase 8 (T90) Global namespace reflective surface.
#
# Global is a stub namespace exposing a reflective view of the active
# realm's bindings.  At v1.0 only `length` is defined — the count of
# slots installed on realm->global_object's hidden class.
#
# Future v1.x: Global.names() returning a List<String> of slot names,
# Global.at(name) for slot lookup, etc.  Tracked in backlog.

# The active realm has at least the 15 v1.0 built-in globals plus
# whatever the post-loop hooks add (Pair / Triplet / Tuple / Exception /
# Math / System / Global / CallMessage at Phase 8).  Length > 15 is
# a stable conservative lower bound.
Global.length() > 15
[00000000] true
